explanation:
{
    "explanation": "Q1 first filters SALES to products with all sales between Jan 1 and Mar 31, 2019, then joins with PRODUCT. Q2 joins all sales first, then groups by product and filters groups where all sales fall within that date range. The difference arises when a product has sales both inside and outside the date range: Q1 excludes it (subquery returns no rows for that product), while Q2 includes it (grouping includes all sales, and HAVING condition fails).",
